# ModelGate 本地模拟调用：不发送给外部模型、不产生模型 API 费用。
# 先执行 scripts/start-demo.ps1，默认 8010 端口。

### 列出模型（虚拟 Key，与管理员登录令牌独立）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8010/v1/models
Authorization: Bearer sk-demo-local

### 非流式聊天
POST http://127.0.0.1:8010/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer sk-demo-local
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
  "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "解释一下模型网关的故障切换"}],
  "stream": false
}

### SSE 流式聊天
POST http://127.0.0.1:8010/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer sk-demo-local
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
  "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "介绍 ModelGate Demo"}],
  "stream": true
}
